<title>VENEZUELA: Electricidad de Caracas declares shr div.</title>
<headline>Electricidad de Caracas declares shr div.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading Venezuelan utility Electricidad de Caracas said Thursday it would give shareholders a one for six ordinary share dividend, pending approval from the National Securities Commission.</p>
<p>The company did not give a date for the dividend, which will be the second to be declared this year after a one for 25 share dividend on May 26.</p>
<p>Electricidad is the benchmark stock on the Caracas bolsa.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
